{"id":"8cc82b21370b435c","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Level Product Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree — ZFC Tree11 Level Product Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree — ZFC Tree11 Level Product Tree","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]]","[[58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree — ZFC Tree11 Level Product Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code\">58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ce50b9a751a8ba69\" href=\"?note=ce50b9a751a8ba69\" title=\"58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism\">58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProductTree}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProductTree}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\preccurlyeq_P,\\mathcal T,\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(P,\\preccurlyeq_P,\\mathcal T,\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> is the set-coded function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the tree-order predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the ordered-pair predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code\">58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\\)</span> compares levels by an isomorphism of principal predecessor orders</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProductTree}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProductTree}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the predicate defined here</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,T,R,y,U,S\\in V\">\\(x,T,R,y,U,S\\in V\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\\)</span> 的六个参数；本辅助关系保留包含当前节点的主初段约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}same\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S(x,T,R,y,U,S)\\leftrightarrow x\\in T\\land y\\in U\\land\n\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\\!\\left(f;\\{z\\in T:\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\},R\\cap\\bigl(\\{z\\in T:\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\times\\{z\\in T:\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\bigr);\\{z\\in U:\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\},S\\cap\\bigl(\\{z\\in U:\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\}\\times\\{z\\in U:\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\}\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}same\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S(x,T,R,y,U,S)\\leftrightarrow x\\in T\\land y\\in U\\land\n\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\\!\\left(f;\\{z\\in T:\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\},R\\cap\\bigl(\\{z\\in T:\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\times\\{z\\in T:\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\bigr);\\{z\\in U:\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\},S\\cap\\bigl(\\{z\\in U:\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\}\\times\\{z\\in U:\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\}\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}level\\text{-}product\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProductTree}_S(P,\\preccurlyeq_P,\\mathcal T,\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\mathcal T,I,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal T(i),\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land P=\\Bigl\\{a\\in\\bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal C\\bigr)^I:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;a(i)\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\\bigl(a(i),\\mathcal T(i),\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(i),a(j),\\mathcal T(j),\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\;\\Bigl(p\\in\\preccurlyeq_P\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in P\\;\\exists b\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,a,b)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\langle a(i),b(i)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(i)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}level\\text{-}product\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProductTree}_S(P,\\preccurlyeq_P,\\mathcal T,\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\mathcal T,I,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal T(i),\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land P=\\Bigl\\{a\\in\\bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal C\\bigr)^I:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;a(i)\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\\bigl(a(i),\\mathcal T(i),\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(i),a(j),\\mathcal T(j),\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\;\\Bigl(p\\in\\preccurlyeq_P\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in P\\;\\exists b\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,a,b)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\langle a(i),b(i)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(i)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The index and codomains of both families are witnessed by the registered ternary function predicate. Equal level is defined order-theoretically from predecessor orders, so nodes need not be sequence codes with an unsupported <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}\">\\(\\operatorname{lh}\\)</span> operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code","status":"resolved","id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"ce50b9a751a8ba69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ is the set-coded function predicate (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the tree-order predicate (see [[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code","status":"resolved","id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the ordered-pair predicate (see [[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProductTree}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"P,\\preccurlyeq_P,\\mathcal T,\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProductTree}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x,T,R,y,U,S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}same\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S(x,T,R,y,U,S)\\leftrightarrow x\\in T\\land y\\in U\\land\n\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\\!\\left(f;\\{z\\in T:\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\},R\\cap\\bigl(\\{z\\in T:\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\times\\{z\\in T:\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\bigr);\\{z\\in U:\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\},S\\cap\\bigl(\\{z\\in U:\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\}\\times\\{z\\in U:\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\}\\bigr)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}level\\text{-}product\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11LevelProductTree}_S(P,\\preccurlyeq_P,\\mathcal T,\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\mathcal T,I,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal T(i),\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land P=\\Bigl\\{a\\in\\bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal C\\bigr)^I:\n\\forall i\\in I\\;a(i)\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\mathrm{SameTreeLevel}_S\\bigl(a(i),\\mathcal T(i),\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(i),a(j),\\mathcal T(j),\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\;\\Bigl(p\\in\\preccurlyeq_P\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in P\\;\\exists b\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,a,b)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\langle a(i),b(i)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_\\bullet(i)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}","display":false}],"bytes":3270,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3792","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-level-product-tree]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["d25b709595952a78","36d7463d215be751","c7cf057d5daacec1","ce50b9a751a8ba69"]}